182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 98 0 R
/E (We are a team of students from different countries, working together across multiple locations. Due to this, we schedule regular weekly meetings where we prepare for the weekly challenges, discuss progress, and divide upcoming tasks. This helps us stay aligned and avoid confusion about who is responsible for what. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
183 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
