349 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (SAF is a fuel produced from non-fossil sources, such as waste fats, oils, and greases, that can be mixed with traditional jet fuel without requiring aircraft modifications. Unlike fossil fuels, which release carbon that has been locked underground for millions of years, SAF recycles carbon that is already in the biosphere. Over its full lifecycle, SAF can reduce carbon emissions by up to 80% compared to traditional jet fuel. \(IATA, 2025\) )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
